WEBVTT

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:33.139
Then I thought about
the craziest idea of all the ideas:

00:05:34.527 --> 00:05:35.976
to actually do it.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.047
(Laughter)

00:05:37.071 --> 00:05:40.483
To actually try to hold
my breath past the point

00:05:40.507 --> 00:05:43.438
that doctors would
consider you brain dead.

00:05:45.768 --> 00:05:49.976
So, I started researching
into pearl divers.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.976
You know, because they go down
for four minutes on one breath.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.576
And when I was researching pearl divers,
I found the world of free-diving.

00:05:57.528 --> 00:06:01.480
It was the most amazing thing
that I ever discovered, pretty much.